DESCRIPTION                   = "This table contains mineral abundances and
 analytical errors derived from diffraction-all K-alpha diffraction data for
 the Mammoth Lakes 2 sample in CheMin cell number 2a (Kapton window), which
 had previously held the sample Mineral King. The analysis is based on RDA
 file CMB_772370873RDA42221072496CH00111P1. Mineral identifications,
 abundances and analytical errors for crystalline phases were determined
 using the program JADE. A minor amount of goethite may be present but could
 not be confirmed. High intensity in the low 2-theta region and a broad
 amorphous hump were modeled using FULLPAT to indicate that ~60 +/- 23
 weight% of the total sample consists of X-ray amorphous materials. All
 errors cited are 2-sigma. Column 1 of the table lists mineral
 identifications, column 2 lists the mineral abundances in weight percent,
 and column 3 indicates the estimated analytical errors."
END_OBJECT                    = SPREADSHEET
END

